The data in this directory is derived from the Open Food Facts database.

Contains data from Open Food Facts (https://openfoodfacts.org), available under the
Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
Individual contents of the database are available under the Database Contents License (DbCL) 1.0:
https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/dbcl/1-0/

This directory, including the product extract (catalog/), the question bank (questions/) and
the graded results (results/, runs/), is a Derivative Database of Open Food Facts and is made
available under the Open Database License 1.0. The method used to produce it is the script
scripts/build_snapshot.py (extract) and src/catalog_audit/questions.py (question bank).

Changes from the source: a random sample of 5,000 products; only the fields listed in
catalog/manifest.json; per-100 g nutrition values only; product images excluded.

The source code of this repository is licensed separately, under the MIT license (../LICENSE).
